cs"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital laboratory workflows"},{"text":"Image analysis"},{"text":"AI-assisted diagnostics"},{"text":"Integrated laboratory information systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Multi-Omics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Proteomics"},{"text":"Metabolomics"},{"text":"Genomics"},{"text":"Biomarker discovery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Laboratory Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QC trends"},{"text":"Turnaround time"},{"text":"Test volumes"},{"text":"Error rates"},{"text":"Instrument performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc Biochemistry"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical Chemistry"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Human Physiology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical Enzymology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Biochemical Assays"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Spectrophotometry"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical Analyzers"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Immunoassay Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Electrolyte Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Laboratory Quality Control"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Method Verification"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Biostatistics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Reference Interval Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"LIS Awareness"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel / Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical Laboratory Internship"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant PG Qualification"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain major biochemical pathways"},{"text":"Understand human physiology relevant to laboratory testing"},{"text":"Explain common clinical chemistry tests"},{"text":"Understand liver, kidney and lipid profiles"},{"text":"Understand glucose and endocrine testing"},{"text":"Explain common biochemical biomarkers"},{"text":"Perform basic biochemical assays"},{"text":"Use a spectrophotometer"},{"text":"Understand clinical chemistry analyzers"},{"text":"Understand immunoassay principles"},{"text":"Understand electrolyte measurement"},{"text":"Perform basic laboratory QC analysis"},{"text":"Interpret QC charts conceptually"},{"text":"Understand calibration and method verification"},{"text":"Understand reference intervals"},{"text":"Apply basic biostatistics"},{"text":"Work with laboratory datasets"},{"text":"Understand LIS workflows"},{"text":"Maintain laboratory documentation"},{"text":"Follow laboratory safety and quality procedures"},{"text":"Complete a clinical laboratory internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the student should not rely on B.Sc Biochemistry alone if the objective is an advanced clinical specialist role."},{"type":"p","text":"A stronger positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Biochemistry","Clinical Chemistry","Laboratory Instrumentation","Quality Control","Biostatistics","Clinical Data","Clinical Laboratory Internship","Relevant PG Qualification"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The distinction between laboratory analyst/technician roles and formally recognized Clinical Biochemist positions should be made carefully because eligibility can vary by institution, employer and applicable professional regulations."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Career Pathways"},{"type":"table","header":["Pathway","Core Focus","Long-Term Direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Clinical Chemistry"},{"text":"Routine biochemical testing"},{"text":"Clinical Chemistry Specialist"}],[{"text":"Diagnostic Biochemistry"},{"text":